    "preamble": "Santosh Laxman Gaikwad vs The State Of Maharashtra on 24 June, 2022 Author: N. J. Jamadar Bench: N. J. Jamadar 1-ab In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.1648 Of 2022 Santosh Laxman Gaikwad ...Applican vs. Vishal The State of Maharashtra ...Responde Subhash Parekar Mr. Rupesh Zade, for the Applicant Digitally signed by Vishal Subhash Mrs. J.S. Lohkare, App, for the State. Parekar Date: 2022.06.27 10:26:58 +0530 Coram : N. J. Jamadar, J. Date : June 24, 2022 P.C.: 1. 2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R. No. 285 of 2022 registered with Baramati City police station, Pune for the offences punishable under sections 328, 188, 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and section 26(2) (iv), 27, 30(2), 31 and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
